    "findings": [
      "Replaced invalid b\"moriarty/2\\n\\naction settle() {}\\n\" sentinel payload with the exact valid moriarty/2 TwoDeliveries source as an inline raw Rust string literal inside fs::write, ensuring inspect --target discriminates availability precedence against real valid Core 2 source.",
      "Changed TempRoot::new from fs::create_dir_all(&dir) to fs::create_dir(&dir) so each test root fails fast if a directory path already exists rather than reusing an existing directory, while keeping inner srs_dir creation unchanged.",
      "Verified all 17 native-gated route argvs (including flattened call_io::Input, signed_call_io::Input, proof_io::Input, and ActionInput), 6 clap exit-2 cases, and 4 semantic exit-1 cases against baseline clap definitions, and synchronized the 27-entry catalog with the exact test labels and membership.",
      "Confirmed borrowed string tuple destructuring in clap_cases and semantic_cases compiles cleanly under standard Rust Deref (&[&str]) and Pattern (&&str) implementations without superfluous edits."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Unchanged directory tree snapshots, sentinel contents, error precedence, and static source audit do NOT prove the absence of read-only filesystem syscalls (such as open/read/stat) prior to emitting the native-unavailable diagnostic; no syscall tracing (e.g., strace) or I/O seam instrumentation was executed.",
      "This task only authors the source repair patch and catalog without running cargo, mori, compilers, or default-feature/no-native test executions.",
      "Independent non-author security review and exact future test execution remain required."
    ],
    "reviewToken": "doctorwatson-cli-native-boundary-gemini-source-repair-20261018-a4-whole-source-patch",
    "sourcePatch": "--- a/native_feature_boundary.rs\n+++ b/native_feature_boundary.rs\n@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@\n             nanos,\n             seq\n         ));\n-        fs::create_dir_all(&dir).expect(\"create temp root\");\n+        fs::create_dir(&dir).expect(\"create temp root\");\n         Self(dir)\n     }\n \n@@ -351,7 +351,21 @@\n         if populate {\n             fs::write(\n                 temp.path().join(\"agreement.mori\"),\n-                b\"moriarty/2\\n\\naction settle() {}\\n\",\n+                r#\"language \"moriarty/2\";\n+agreement TwoDeliveries {\n+  state phase: UInt = 0;\n+  asset UNIT = { network: \"local\", issuer: \"independent-staged-test-oracle\", reference: \"UNIT\", scale: 0 };\n+  action deliver() {\n+    transfer(UNIT, \"alice\", \"bob\", 7);\n+    next phase = 1;\n+    await approval(ok: Bool) when ok;\n+    transfer(UNIT, \"alice\", \"bob\", 3);\n+    await receipt(seen: Bool) when seen;\n+    next phase = 2;\n+    emit \"done\"(phase);\n+  }\n+  action declare() { liability(\"duty\", UNIT, \"alice\", \"bob\", 0); }\n+}\"#,\n             )\n             .expect(\"write source sentinel\");\n             fs::create_dir_all(temp.path().join(\"srs_dir\")).expect(\"create fake srs_dir\");\n",
    "summary": "Repaired crates/mori/tests/native_feature_boundary.rs via minimal unified diff (TempRoot::new uses fs::create_dir(&dir) and agreement.mori sentinel uses the exact valid moriarty/2 TwoDeliveries raw string literal) and aligned the 27-case catalog with all route, clap, and semantic precedence cases.",
